@startuml class
title Class Diagram - Sistem Penyewaan Garasi Kendaraan
caption Tipe "?" = boleh kosong (nullable). Nama atribut sama dengan kolom tabel pada ERD V2.

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  HeaderBackgroundColor #DCE9FB
  BorderColor #1F2A44
  ArrowColor #1F2A44
}
hide circle
hide empty members

class User {
  - id: int
  - name: string
  - email: string {unique}
  - password: string
  - role: UserRole
  --
  + isAdmin(): boolean
  + canRent(): boolean
}

class Renter {
  - id: int
  - id_user: int {unique}
  - phone_number: string
  - status: RenterStatus
  - nik: string {16 digit}
  --
  + verify(accept: boolean): void
  + canRent(): boolean
}

class Vehicle {
  - id: int
  - id_renter: int
  - vehicle_type: VehicleType
  - plate_number: string?
  - brand_model: string
  - battery_kwh: decimal?
  --
  + canBeParkedIn(type: GarageType): boolean
}

class Rental {
  - id: int
  - id_renter: int
  - id_garage: int
  - id_vehicle: int
  - rental_type: RentalType
}

class Garage {
  - id: int
  - code: string {S|C|E + 3 digit}
  - type: GarageType
  - daily_price: int
  - charging_price: int?
  - status: GarageStatus
  --
  + isAvailable(): boolean
}

class Invoice {
  - id: int
  - id_rental: int
  - type: InvoiceType
  - start_date: Date
  - end_date: Date
  - duration_days: int
  - rent_fee: int
  - charging_fee: int
  - total_fee: int
  - payment_proof_path: string
}

class "Daftar Enum" as Enums <<enumeration>> #FFF4CC {
  UserRole: ADMIN | RENTER
  RenterStatus: PENDING | APPROVED | REJECTED
  VehicleType: BIKE | MOTORCYCLE | CAR | EV
  GarageType: BIKE (S) | CAR (C) | EV (E)
  GarageStatus: AVAILABLE | USED
  RentalType: DAILY | MONTHLY
  InvoiceType: INITIAL | EXTENSION
  --
  VehicleType: requiresPlate(), requiresBattery()
  GarageType: prefix(), allowedVehicleTypes()
}

User "1" -right- "0..1" Renter : has profile
Renter "1" -right- "0..*" Vehicle : owns
Renter "1" -down- "0..*" Rental : rents
Vehicle "1" -down- "0..*" Rental : used in
Rental "0..*" -right- "1" Garage : rented
Rental "1" *-down- "1..*" Invoice : billed through

Invoice -[hidden]right- Enums

note as Notes
  <b>Catatan</b>
  - Registrasi membuat 1 User (role RENTER) + 1 Renter
    (status PENDING) dalam satu transaksi.
  - Admin hanya punya User, tanpa Renter.
  - Renter.canRent() dan User.canRent(): status APPROVED.
  - Sewa baru membuat 1 Rental + 1 Invoice (INITIAL).
  - Perpanjangan: Invoice baru (EXTENSION) untuk garasi yang
    sama dengan Rental. Tidak ada tabel perpanjangan.
  - Tanggal mulai/selesai dan semua biaya disimpan di Invoice;
    Rental hanya menghubungkan Renter, Garage, dan Vehicle.
  - Vehicle.canBeParkedIn(): BIKE, MOTORCYCLE -> S | CAR -> C |
    EV -> C atau E. Plat wajib kecuali BIKE.
  - Biaya listrik = battery_kwh x charging_price
    (hanya EV di garasi E).
  - Sewa bulanan = 25 x daily_price. Sewa harian maksimal
    jumlah hari bulan berjalan - 1.
  - Method Checkpoint 2-4 (login, register, buat garasi batch,
    hitung biaya, perpanjang, laporan) ditambahkan setelah dibuat.
end note
Vehicle -[hidden]down- Notes
@enduml
